{% block planned_tasks_guidance %}
{#
  PLANNED TASKS. A table with the columns Task, Unit, What it delivers, Depends on, Where it
  lives, collapsed in one expandable block under the graph image when there is one, and
  shown without one for a plan of one task, whose lone row a block would only hide: one row
  per task, every cell one line, and "What it delivers" a short phrase. The
  Unit column names the unit the task changes. Where it lives is the location the plan store
  reports for the task, never one composed by hand.

  Every row's task, unit and dependencies render from the `graph` answer, the plan store's
  own reading of the plan, and the Architecture's unit names are that graph's groups, so the
  writer authors only `delivers`. Where it lives is the qualified id the store names. For a plan of more than one task with at least one
  dependency edge, the flow also renders that graph, each task inside its unit's box, and
  the section opens with it: `dag_image` names that generated image and the document holds
  it as an asset. The writer never draws, edits or replaces it, and a plan of one task or of
  no edge answers `dag_image` with `""` and shows none, because its picture would only
  repeat the table.
#}
{% endblock %}
{% block planned_tasks %}
## Planned tasks

{% if dag_image %}
![Dependency graph of the plan's tasks](./{{ dag_image }})

{% endif %}
{% set task_count = (graph.nodes | rejectattr("external") | list | length) if graph.nodes is defined else (planned_tasks | length) %}
{% if task_count > 1 %}
<details>
<summary>All {{ task_count }} planned tasks</summary>

{% endif %}
{% if graph.nodes is defined %}
| Task | Unit | What it delivers | Depends on | Where it lives |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
{% for node in graph.nodes if not node.external %}
{% set deps = namespace(titles=[]) %}
{% for edge in graph.edges if edge.to == node.id %}
{% for other in graph.nodes if other.id == edge["from"] %}
{% set deps.titles = deps.titles + [other.title] %}
{% endfor %}
{% endfor %}
| {{ cell(node.title) }} | {{ cell(node.group or "none") }} | {{ cell(delivers[node.id] | default("")) }} | {{ cell(deps.titles | join("; ") or "none") }} | {{ cell(node.id) }} |
{% endfor %}

{% else %}
| Task | Unit | What it delivers | Depends on | Where it lives |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
{% for row in planned_tasks %}
| {{ cell(row.task) }} | {{ cell(row.unit) }} | {{ cell(row.delivers) }} | {{ cell(row.depends_on or "none") }} | {{ cell(row.location) }} |
{% endfor %}

{% endif %}
{% if task_count > 1 %}
</details>
{% endif %}
{% endblock %}
